OL,3,GNEWSASwinney 'concerned' over Flynn
OL,4,Amissing by-election for World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney was "concerned" that
OL,7,FStephen Flynn wanted to be in the US
OL,8,Ffor the World Cup on the day of the
OL,9,FAberdeen South by-election, it has
OL,10,Femerged.
OL,12,FFlynn, the SNP's former Westminster
OL,13,Fleader, formally asked to attend the
OL,14,Ftournament on 26 May - less than three
OL,15,Fweeks after he was elected as an MSP.
OL,17,FE-mails released under Freedom of
OL,18,FInformation, first reported by the
OL,19,FDaily Record, show that he intended to
OL,20,Fbe absent from 18 to 27 June with plans
OL,21,Ffor a junior Scottish government
OL,22,Fminister to provide cover.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
