OL,3,GNEWSASwinney 'concerned' over Flynn
OL,4,Amissing by-election for World Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first minister's office replied to
OL,7,Fsay that Swinney would approve the trip
OL,8,F"on an exceptional basis although he is
OL,9,Fconcerned Mr Flynn does not propose to
OL,10,Fbe here on 18th June."
